        "message": "请在聚水潭商品列表中筛选目标商品并打开“批量上架/上架到店铺”弹窗，准备好后按回车继续..."
      },
      {
        "name": "select_platform_1688",
        "action": "click",
        "selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "required": false
      },
      {
        "name": "search_store_name",
        "action": "input",
        "source": "store_name",
        "required": false,
        "selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "click_store_search",
        "action": "click",
        "selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "required": false
      },
      {
        "name": "match_history_candidate",
        "action": "match_candidates",
        "required": false,
        "row_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "title_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "store_name_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "source_id_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "use_button_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "fallback_selector": {
          "by": "css",
          "value": ""
        },
        "invalid_error_detection": {
          "enabled": true,
          "timeout_seconds": 1.5,
          "keywords": [
            "资料失效",
            "日志失效",
            "已不可用"
          ],
          "message_selector": {
            "by": "css",
            "value": ""
          },
          "close_selector": {
            "by": "css",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "confirm_store_selection",
        "action": "manual",
        "message": "请确认已选中目标授权店铺并进入 1688 发布页，完成后按回车继续..."
      }
    ]
  }
